# insomnia_Automaton — secrets for THIS project only
# Copy to .env.local. Use brand-new credentials. Do not reuse keys from other projects/accounts.

# --- Required to host the code on a NEW GitHub account (not pavanik) ---
# Prefer: authorize GitHub in the Cloud Agent UI for the new account.
# Or paste a fine-scoped PAT from that new account:
# GITHUB_TOKEN=ghp_...
# GITHUB_OWNER=your-new-github-username
# GITHUB_REPO=insomnia_Automaton

# --- Optional free inference (new provider accounts) ---
# GROQ_API_KEY=
# GEMINI_API_KEY=

# --- Optional later (not needed for Day-0 demo) ---
# SMTP / email channel, Stripe/payment webhook, hosting tokens
